      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe the veterinarians, veterinary nurses, and receptionists as exceptionally kind, attentive, and knowledgeable. Reviewers frequently highlight Dr. Shirosky, Dr. Bujanda, and technician Leeanne for taking time to explain conditions and proactively calling owners after visits."
      }
