      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the patient, soothing approach shown to anxious dogs and sensitive cats during examinations. Reviewers note that staff shower animals with affection, easing tension for nervous rescues and making senior pets feel safe during medical procedures and check-ups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective diagnostic and ongoing care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report excellent clinical results for both urgent issues and complex chronic conditions, such as successfully treating feline hypertension. Clients value rapid diagnostic testing and personalized treatment plans that keep aging dogs and cats healthy and active."
      }
    }
  ],
